<title>USA: Indium Corp cuts posted price to $225 per kilo.</title>
<headline>Indium Corp cuts posted price to $225 per kilo.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indium Corp of America said it cut its posted price for indium by $50 to a new price of $225.00 per kilogram, effective October 17.</p>
<p>The new price is equivalent to $7 per troy ounce.</p>
<p>The company said the cut reflected current market conditions.</p>
<p>Indium Corp has announced a series of price cuts this year, beginning in March when prices were cut $60 to $465.00 per kilo.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
